  "body_text": "How are you doing TODAY~\n已经不再刷\n每天的新闻了\n每天还挺忙的\n这几天 很多朋友加我的微信，实在对不住了，没有一一处理\n在这里，\n再次说声 对不起\n买豆豆我们统一以下的路径\n淘宝店铺 “有容乃大咖啡补给站”\n目前仅限 浦东区域\n有赞小程序已经下架了很多产品，为了更好的管理库存和发货\n线上客服同事会接待您的询问，会响应慢一些，请耐心等待下哈~\n发货的速度这几天再加速了，目前闪送的单子待处理的应该3-4天全部能消化完\n可能今天下单，明天就安排了呢~ U NEVER KNOW\n大磨豆机魔怔了，所以\n不再接单磨粉\n挂耳包的产能非常的有限，可能\n下周会限量发售一批 瑰夏混挂\n今天收到消息，外地有客人收到了我们的快递，估计是之前发出被卡在路上的，还没有收到快递的解禁通知，所以外地的朋友们还请稍安勿躁哈~友商的豆豆可以买起来，等上海结界破了，我们再续前缘~\nSTAY SAFE ~ LIFE GOES ON",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          How are you doing TODAY~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"000Mmm142L6Vy4\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000000Mmm142L6Vy4.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://isure6.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C200003xwemA3OvFqb.m4a?guid=2000000052&amp;vkey=22ADF051FC60F3557D7844C0395EE8EE32AB8E8632A07FBB5E900EAE940AC378F4DD905C590DBB2D79E149F8926BB754154A9C10C1472BF0&amp;uin=&amp;fromtag=20052\" class=\"js_editor_qqmusic qqmusic_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"003xwemA3OvFqb\" music_name=\"Life Goes On\" musicid=\"336203730\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"003xwemA3OvFqb\" play_length=\"300\" singer=\"2Pac - Greatest Hits\" src=\"/mp/readtemplate?t=app_editor/music&amp;singer=2Pac%20-%20Greatest%20Hits&amp;music_name=Life%20Goes%20On&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000000Mmm142L6Vy4.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          已经不再刷\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          每天的新闻了\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          每天还挺忙的\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这几天 很多朋友加我的微信，实在对不住了，没有一一处理\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在这里，\n          <strong>\n           再次说声 对不起\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          买豆豆我们统一以下的路径\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           淘宝店铺 “有容乃大咖啡补给站”\n           <strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;\">\n            目前仅限 浦东区域\n           </strong>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有赞小程序已经下架了很多产品，为了更好的管理库存和发货\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          线上客服同事会接待您的询问，会响应慢一些，请耐心等待下哈~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          发货的速度这几天再加速了，目前闪送的单子待处理的应该3-4天全部能消化完\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          可能今天下单，明天就安排了呢~ U NEVER KNOW\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          大磨豆机魔怔了，所以\n          <strong>\n           不再接单磨粉\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          挂耳包的产能非常的有限，可能\n          <strong>\n           下周会限量发售一批 瑰夏混挂\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今天收到消息，外地有客人收到了我们的快递，估计是之前发出被卡在路上的，还没有收到快递的解禁通知，所以外地的朋友们还请稍安勿躁哈~友商的豆豆可以买起来，等上海结界破了，我们再续前缘~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          STAY SAFE ~ LIFE GOES ON\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
